cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference DerivGuard-MRM, please cite this software release."
title: "DerivGuard-MRM: Evidence-Controlled Model-Risk Validation for SPX Option Pricing"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bae"
    given-names: "Jinwoo"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-28
url: "https://github.com/ReviveCoding/DerivGuard-MRM"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ReviveCoding/DerivGuard-MRM"
abstract: >-
  Research software for model-risk validation of SPX option-pricing models,
  including Heston calibration, SVI/SSVI challengers, uncertainty-aware
  slicing, Greek and valuation disagreement, stress testing, DVE diagnostics,
  fresh locked/OOD evaluation, and evidence-integrity controls.
keywords:
  - quantitative finance
  - derivatives
  - options pricing
  - Heston model
  - SVI
  - SSVI
  - model risk management
  - model validation
  - stress testing
  - out-of-distribution validation
